// Clean data model & key handling — QlikView 12 Data Architect (QV12DA)
// Goal: Eliminate synthetic keys and circular references.
// Concepts: Synthetic keys, Circular references, JOIN vs KEEP vs CONCATENATE, Composite/AutoNumber keys, Table Viewer validation
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

